cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MarketData Quant Suite"
abstract: >-
  Research software for trustworthy AI in quantitative finance. A shared,
  confirmed-only US market-data gateway feeds point-in-time research projects,
  including two research lines in preparation: LLM-guided formulaic factor
  mining under multiple-testing control and a sealed hold-out, and a governed,
  point-in-time LLM copilot with a numeric-grounding benchmark. Committed
  results are synthetic harness validations; LLM and real-market results are
  pending.
authors:
  - given-names: "Siyan"
    family-names: "Chen"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SiyanChen929/marketdata-quant-suite"
version: "0.1.0"
keywords:
  - quantitative finance
  - large language models
  - factor mining
  - multiple testing
  - point-in-time data
  - LLM agents
  - reproducibility
